          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "In the ordered algebra with generators $\\theta^1,\\theta^2,\\bar\\theta^{\\dot1},\\bar\\theta^{\\dot2}$ and measure $d^4\\theta=d\\bar\\theta^{\\dot2}d\\bar\\theta^{\\dot1}d\\theta^2d\\theta^1$, let\n\n$$f=c\\,\\theta^1\\bar\\theta^{\\dot1}\\theta^2\\bar\\theta^{\\dot2}+d\\,\\theta^1\\theta^2\\bar\\theta^{\\dot1}\\bar\\theta^{\\dot2},\\qquad c,d\\in\\mathbb C.$$\n\nThen $\\int d^4\\theta\\,f=d-c$.",
