          "title": "Fixed-order on-shell amplitude equivalence under local field redefinition",
          "reference": "items/thm-aqft-field-redefinition-observable-equivalence-at-fixed-order.md",
          "design_state": "Assigned item fully authored in Step 1; readiness is recorded separately.",
